# Public MCP vhost (S4 · #462 · RFC-037 §6) — ROUTING OWNED BY THIS REPO.
#
# The shared Caddy edge engine is owned by podcast_scraper (ADR-114); this file
# is a tenant vhost dropped into /etc/caddy/sites/orrery-mcp.caddy by
# ops/deploy_caddy_vhosts.sh (`caddy adapt`-gated, then restart).
#
# Upstream: the orrery-mcp container on loopback 8091 (compose
# `compose/docker-compose.prod.yml` service `mcp`; ADR-114 port map — 8080
# podcast, 8090 orrery web, 8091 orrery mcp). The server itself enforces auth
# (S4: dev bearer; #534 upgrades to OAuth 2.1 with lab-api as the AS) and its
# own rate/concurrency caps — the vhost only terminates TLS and proxies.
#
# DNS: mcp.orrerylearn.com must resolve to the box BEFORE this file lands, or
# ACME retries burn Let's Encrypt rate limits (same caveat as orrery.caddy).
#
# Rollback: rm /etc/caddy/sites/orrery-mcp.caddy && sudo systemctl restart caddy.
mcp.orrerylearn.com {
	import hardened
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8091
}
